BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Using what I learned at GOOD25 to improve our center’s user expe
 rience - Dori Sajdak [University at Buffalo]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T133000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T134000
DTSTAMP:20261020T211014Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-KGGGH3@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:The GOOD25 conference served as a significant platform for adv
 ancing knowledge beyond the fundamentals of Open OnDemand. Numerous presen
 ters introduced tools and strategies aimed at extending the capabilities o
 f the OnDemand portal and enhancing the overall user experience within hig
 h-performance computing (HPC) environments. This presentation will analyze
  several of the most influential approaches highlighted during the event a
 nd discuss their successful integration into our center’s operations ove
 r the past year.
LOCATION:Main Hall
